WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Move to dodge approaching enemies and projectiles.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Stop moving to aim and fire automatically.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Keep moving when enemy projectiles get too close.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Clear the enemy waves to finish the room.

00:42.000 --> 00:50.000
Defeat the remaining enemies to earn an upgrade.

00:51.200 --> 00:55.867
Choose an upgrade: piercing arrows, attack power, or healing.

00:55.867 --> 01:00.000
Piercing arrows selected. Ready for the next room.

01:00.000 --> 01:10.000
A new room brings another wave of enemies.
